## Local overlay and deliberate divergences

This repo adds local files under `skills/drawio-diagram/references/local/` and scripts under `skills/drawio-diagram/scripts/` to improve authoring quality on top of the upstream reference set.

Deliberate differences from the upstream Claude Code plugin skill (`plugins/claude-code`, formerly `skill-cli`):

- Keep `.drawio` as the visible source of truth after export
- Add layout and quality gate documents derived from real diagram failures
- Add deterministic XML and layout validators
- Support multiple agent harnesses with dedicated install docs
